build/
build-*/
# An in-source `cmake .` leaves this at the working root, where build/ and
# build-*/ above do not reach it -- this project builds out of source, so
# nothing anticipated anything landing here. Ignored rather than only deleted,
# because deleting it fixes today and this stops it coming back.
/CMakeFiles/
.cache/
compile_commands.json
*.o
*.a
*.dxf

# Sadie's scratch AutoLISP and its output. Deliberately invisible to git, so
# NOTHING the build, the tests or a release depends on may live here -- the
# packaging script and the AutoCAD conformance fixture both started here and
# were tracked in spite of this rule, which made the rule protect nothing and
# set a trap for the next file added. They are in packaging/ and tests/acad/.
/scripts/

# Loose working files: sample drawings, screenshots, crash reports, output from
# other CAD applications. Ignored so they have somewhere to live that is not the
# working root, where `git add -A` finds them.
/examples/

# macOS Finder metadata and editor backups. Here because a `git add -A` swept
# them into a commit once; they are noise on one of the two platforms this
# builds on and never a deliverable on either.
.DS_Store
*~

# Machine-specific tool permissions. The skills beside it ARE shared.
.claude/settings.local.json
